cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  UniERP: an open-source, self-hostable multi-tenant application
  platform
message: If you use UniERP in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kannan
    family-names: Rajagopal
    alias: kannan19302
repository-code: https://github.com/kannan19302/UniERP
url: https://github.com/kannan19302/UniERP
abstract: >-
  UniERP is a self-hostable, multi-tenant application platform that ships an ERP
  as its first-party app suite. Tenant isolation is enforced by PostgreSQL
  row-level security with FORCE and a NOBYPASSRLS application role rather than by
  application code, third-party extensions execute in a capability-scoped V8
  isolate under metered CPU, memory, query and egress budgets, and AI features
  run locally against Ollama and pgvector so tenant data does not leave the
  operator's infrastructure.
keywords:
  - erp
  - multi-tenancy
  - row-level-security
  - self-hosted
  - postgresql
  - sandboxing
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
